generateModelBySelections()
  └─ no active regenerationContext → new model path
       ├─ generateModel(input) → LLM returns raw process XML
       └─ stagePendingNewModelDraft(generatedModel, { creationContext })
            ├─ resolveModelCreationContext()
            │    collects: documentId, documentVersionId, documentVersionName,
            │              selections (from documentViewerStore), prompt
            │
            ├─ prepareModelDataForCreation(modelData, creationContext)
            │    └─ injectDbpmData(modelData, meta)          ← INJECTION
            │         • parses raw LLM XML
            │         • creates wrapper <description xmlns:dbpm="...">
            │         • prepends <dbpm:info>
            │              <dbpm:document_info>
            │                <dbpm:document_id>
            │                <dbpm:document_version_id>
            │                <dbpm:document_version_name>
            │                <dbpm:text_selections>
            │                <dbpm:prompt>              (if present)
            │         • appends the original process payload nodes
            │         • returns serialized XML (preparedModelData)
            │
            ├─ workspaceStore.editingModel = { id: null }   → state = "new-model-draft"
            └─ modelEditorStore.setData(preparedModelData)  → renders injected XML
                 → #newModelDraftReviewBar becomes visible

  User clicks Save → commitPendingNewModelDraft()
                       └─ createModelAndLink(pendingDraft.preparedModelData)
                            (already injected, sent as-is to backend)
  User clicks Discard → discardPendingNewModelDraft() → clears everything